      "title": "Dividend increased to ₹525",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹525 is 11% higher than last year. Ex-date: 24th July 2026 Payment date: 12th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 1.9%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by both earnings (71% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (79% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 31% per year over the past 10 years and has been stable with no material reductions to payments, indicating a long track record of dividend growth and stability. EPS is expected to grow by 31% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
